# Documentation

- Short implementation notes: `DESIGN.md` (or project equivalent)
- Human requirements / external / internal / test / API docs: `docs/` (git-managed)
- Do not create empty `docs/` before real work starts
- On conflict: **tests/code → DESIGN.md → docs/**
- Never mark unimplemented behavior as done acceptance criteria
